Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Minh Tri <minhtritt1996@gmail.com>
Depends: adaptation-android-generic, phosh, phoc
Replaces: libwlroots12a, getcutout
Provides: adaptation-device
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: Hardware adaptation package for Xiaomi Redmi K30 5G (picasso)
 Provides GPU patch, hardware acceleration, panel backlight service,
 direct phosh launcher, Wi-Fi/Bluetooth kernel modules, ALSA audio,
 60Hz/120Hz display switcher, camera/torch rules, and auto-rotation.

